          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ہٹانا (haṭānā) is built on haṭnā, \"to move out of the way\", which CDIAL lists under haṭṭ, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 13943): this is the form for moving something else."
